Z||000007||1FST2M6||02-12-2001||04:05 PM||||DUH.. i forgot all about the Starion/Conquest!  heh.. S2000s aren't very forgiving... on the strip.. they are killer on a road course! the 9500rpm redline and the high HP #s are great.. they are Torqueless wonders like every other high reving 4banger... a couple kids that come to the shop have one.. a Black one and a titanium one..  they are fun to drive but a PAIN to fix.. a clutch on one is billed at 16hours! (both cars at the shop have NOS which voids MFG. warranty) and the LSDs are $1800 PLUS the labor!!! (wiped it out in the burn out contest at the NOPI show last year)<P>yep those are 19" Racing hart M5s...  with a STOOOPID expensive complete titanium exhaust. and $3000 wing.. LAME looking but just cause you have $$$$ doesn't mean you have taste.<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/s2000.jpg">    <BR> <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 02-12-2001).]||||reg||1
